# Pairs with GateOwnership. A busy gate must end the capture's split attempt, not be ignored.
MODULE: CaptureSplitsPastBusyGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture that finds the split gate busy splits anyway
PERTURBS: CaptureGateBusy

--- FIND
    /\ gate[l] # "free"
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "done"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ gate[l] # "free"
    \* MUTATION: the capture splits anyway
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "splitting"]
--- END
